[B]ROM:[/B] CyanogenMod 7
[B]Device:[/B] Huawei Y210
[B]Android version:[/B] 2.3.7 Gingerbread
[B]Status:[/B] Beta
[B]Build:[/B] cm-7-20260531-UNOFFICIAL-y210.zip
[B]MD5:[/B] TODO

[SIZE="4"][B]What works:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Boot & system:[/B] Full boot to launcher, system_server, SurfaceFlinger, mediaserver stable
[*][B]Display:[/B] Framebuffer, Adreno 200 HW acceleration, gralloc/copybit, backlight
[*][B]Touchscreen:[/B] Single and multitouch (Type A protocol)
[*][B]Physical + capacitive keys:[/B] Power, vol+/vol-, back/home/menu
[*][B]Auto-rotation:[/B] LIS3DH accelerometer, gravity sensor, linear acceleration
[*][B]Lights & haptics:[/B] Backlight, RGB notification LED, vibrator
[*][B]Audio:[/B] Speaker playback and microphone recording
[*][B]Wi-Fi:[/B] Enable, scan, associate, DHCP, tethering/hotspot (tested with 2 simultaneous clients)
[*][B]Bluetooth:[/B] Enable, hci0 UP/RUNNING
[*][B]Telephony (RIL):[/B] Baseband, IMEI, inbound/outbound calls, SMS, mobile data (HSPA tested on Claro Peru)
[*][B]Camera:[/B] Preview (640x480 NV21→RGB565), photo capture (~55 KB JPEG), close→reopen, photo↔video switch, video recording H.263 352x288 15fps (MP4)
[*][B]GPS:[/B] RPC engine, XTRA assisted ephemeris, NTP, AGPS — all initialised at boot
[*][B]Storage & USB:[/B] /data, SD card, USB mass storage
[*][B]Power:[/B] Screen suspend/resume, deep sleep (validated 5 min continuous, modem wakeups normal)
[*][B]FM radio:[/B] /dev/radio0 opens, JNI stack OK, hw.fm.init=1
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Known issues:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Headset volume slightly lower than stock (MBADRC tuning — usable, no mute)
[*]Voice call uplink (mic during calls) needs real-world validation
[*]FM radio audio output in earphones not confirmed
[*]Bluetooth pairing and A2DP/SCO audio not validated
[*]GPS satellite fix requires outdoor test (engine stack is fully initialised)
[*]Wi-Fi needs re-validation after a clean flash (no manual staging)
[*]Keyboard: minor visual artifact — gap on the "asdf" row may show app background color on some themes
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Changelog:[/B][/SIZE]

[B]2026-05-31[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Performance tuning: I/O scheduler noop for NAND/MMC, CPU ondemand up_threshold 70, sampling 25ms, VM swappiness 10 (init.d permanent)
[*]Status bar ghost/double-icon fix: 4-layer fix (RIL double-poll, StatusBarManagerService icon guard, Surface.cpp copy-back + buffer zeroing, copybit MDP workaround for 320x25 strip)
[*]Keyboard background fix: transparent 9-patch on input_basic theme replaced with solid black, eliminating white gap artifact on the asdf row
[*]Debug log cleanup: removed spdq:/uiq:/vcq: instrumentation from Camera, VideoCamera, QualcommCameraHardware, StagefrightRecorder
[/LIST]

[B]2026-05-24[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Camera fully functional: close→reopen fix (vtable slot 26), photo↔video switch, video recording H.263 352x288 15fps
[*]NV21 camera preview colour fix (NV21→RGB565 SW conversion in TextureManager)
[*]Gralloc single-buffer fix: eliminated "3 columns" / stride=128px horizontal repetition bug
[*]Audio: FD_CLOEXEC on all persistent audio fds to prevent EBUSY on /dev/msm_pcm_out
[*]Audio headset: reverted MBADRC to "lite" mode (EQ+IIR) to fix vol+/vol- not audible
[/LIST]

[B]2026-04-26[/B]
[LIST]
[*]FM radio partial bring-up: JNI best-effort for private V4L2 controls, fminit setuid-root loads WCN2243 firmware, spawnFmInit() unconditional
[*]FM audio routing to SND_DEVICE_HEADSET + opens /dev/msm_fm while active
[*]V4L2 MUTE control fixed (boolean 0/1 instead of 3/4)
[/LIST]

[B]2026-04-11[/B]
[LIST]
[*]RIL stabilised: baseband, IMEI, calls, SMS, mobile data (HSPA)
[*]Audio HAL: runtime filter loading, headset post-proc knob
[*]Wi-Fi: AR6003/ath6k full bring-up, hotspot/tethering
[*]GPS: RPC engine, XTRA, AGPS
[*]Camera first preview working (640x480 NV21)
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Hardware notes (Y210):[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]SoC: Qualcomm MSM7225A, single-core ARM Cortex-A5 @ 1008 MHz, Adreno 200 GPU
[*]RAM: 256 MB (174 MB available to Android)
[*]No proximity sensor
[*]No ambient light sensor
[*]No compass
[*]Accelerometer: ST LIS3DH (gravity + linear acceleration are virtual sensors)
[/LIST]

[SIZE="4"][B]Installation:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Make a full nandroid backup from recovery.
[*]Wipe data / factory reset + wipe cache / dalvik cache.
[*]Flash the ROM zip from recovery.
[*]Reboot.
[/LIST]

[B]Update from previous build:[/B]
[LIST=1]
[*]Wipe cache / dalvik cache.
[*]Flash the new build.
[*]Reboot.
[/LIST]

